ng passed by Dreyfus and Nuvolari. At the end of the lap Sommer made a pit stop to change spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":7,"text":"On the seventh lap Chiron made a mistake and dropped to fourth position, being passed by Dreyfus and Nuvolari. At the end of the lap Sommer made a pit stop to change spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":8,"text":"On the eighth lap Varzi already put the last man in the field, Marret, a lap down. In the duel for second position Nuvolari managed to re-pass Dreyfus.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":8,"text":"On the eighth lap Varzi already put the last man in the field, Marret, a lap down. In the duel for second position Nuvolari managed to re-pass Dreyfus.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":9,"text":"Dreyfus spins at the Gambetta hairpin into the straw bales; his engine stalls and he cannot restart it. R\u00fcesch also hits the bales but continues.","q":false,"c":16},{"lap":9,"text":"At the end of the ninth lap Sommer gave up and retired his Maserati to the pit with mechanical trouble.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":9,"text":"Dreyfus spins at the Gambetta hairpin into the straw bales; his engine stalls and he cannot restart it. R\u00fcesch also hits the bales but continues.","q":false,"c":16},{"lap":9,"text":"At the end of the ninth lap Sommer gave up and retired his Maserati to the pit with mechanical trouble.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":10,"text":"Varzi made ten laps in 17m50s (108.1 km/h), leading 11 seconds over Nuvolari, 20 seconds over Chiron and 30 seconds over Trossi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"Varzi made ten laps in 17m50s (108.1 km/h), leading 11 seconds over Nuvolari, 20 seconds over Chiron and 30 seconds over Trossi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"Nuvolari answers Varzi with a 1m44s lap.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":11,"text":"Nuvolari answers Varzi with a 1m44s lap.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":12,"text":"Dell'Orto hands his Alfa Romeo over to Sommer. Delmo retires with spark plug trouble.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":12,"text":"Dell'Orto hands his Alfa Romeo over to Sommer. Delmo retires with spark plug trouble.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":13,"text":"On the 13th lap Straight, who was in fifth position, went into the straw bales at the Gambetta hairpin on the Promenade and had to retire his Maserati with a bent axle.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":13,"text":"On the 13th lap Straight, who was in fifth position, went into the straw bales at the Gambetta hairpin on the Promenade and had to retire his Maserati with a bent axle.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":20,"text":"He was leading Nuvolari, who was in trouble and was slowing down, by 34 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":20,"text":"He was leading Nuvolari, who was in trouble and was slowing down, by 34 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":21,"text":"On the 21st lap Trossi passed Chiron for third position but the duo continued their duel racing close together.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":21,"text":"On the 21st lap Trossi passed Chiron for third position but the duo continued their duel racing close together.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":22,"text":"The car was refuelled fast but the stop lasted 3 \u00bd minutes as the mechanics worked on an engine problem.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":22,"text":"The car was refuelled fast but the stop lasted 3 \u00bd minutes as the mechanics worked on an engine problem.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":23,"text":"Sommer retires for the second time today, the Monza's rear axle damaged.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":23,"text":"Sommer retires for the second time today, the Monza's rear axle damaged.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":27,"text":"At the end of the 27th lap Nuvolari stopped again at his box to retire with a broken piston. The Scuderia Ferrari drivers now held the top three positions.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":27,"text":"At the end of the 27th lap Nuvolari stopped again at his box to retire with a broken piston. The Scuderia Ferrari drivers now held the top three positions.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":30,"text":"Chiron passes Trossi for second; Varzi leads him by 52 seconds with Trossi one second further back.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":30,"text":"Chiron passes Trossi for second; Varzi leads him by 52 seconds with Trossi one second further back.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":32,"text":"On the 32rd lap Trossi managed to regain second place from Chiron.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":32,"text":"On the 32rd lap Trossi managed to regain second place from Chiron.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":47,"text":"Varzi laps fourth-placed Etancelin, who resists; Howe re-passes Veyron.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":47,"text":"Varzi laps fourth-placed Etancelin, who resists; Howe re-passes Veyron.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":50,"text":"On a sign from his pit Varzi speeds up, stretching his lead over Trossi to one minute.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"On a sign from his pit Varzi speeds up, stretching his lead over Trossi to one minute.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":53,"text":"R\u00fcesch makes a three-minute fuel stop, complaining of burns on his left foot from the hot gearbox.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":53,"text":"R\u00fcesch makes a three-minute fuel stop, complaining of burns on his left foot from the hot gearbox.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":61,"text":"Chiron arrives slowly at his pit: fuel, plugs and a hunt for an engine fault cost at least four minutes.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":61,"text":"Chiron arrives slowly at his pit: fuel, plugs and a hunt for an engine fault cost at least four minutes.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":62,"text":"After one slow lap Chiron is back in the pit; the car is retired with a broken valve.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":62,"text":"After one slow lap Chiron is back in the pit; the car is retired with a broken valve.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":80,"text":"R\u00fcesch gives up, unable to bear the burns from the gearbox any longer.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":80,"text":"R\u00fcesch gives up, unable to bear the burns from the gearbox any longer.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":92,"text":"With fuel worries in the Ferrari pit, Trossi slows and is lapped by Varzi; Zehender stops again and loses fourth to Villapadierna.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":92,"text":"With fuel worries in the Ferrari pit, Trossi slows and is lapped by Varzi; Zehender stops again and loses fourth to Villapadierna.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":95,"text":"Trossi, with Etancelin close behind, runs out of fuel 200 metres from the pit and starts pushing.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":95,"text":"Trossi, with Etancelin close behind, runs out of fuel 200 metres from the pit and starts pushing.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":100,"text":"Varzi took the chequered flag to win the race with Etancelin right behind him but a lap down.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Trossi, hurriedly refuelled, takes the flag third, ahead of Villapadierna and Zehender.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":100,"text":"Varzi took the chequered flag to win the race with Etancelin right behind him but a lap down.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Trossi, hurriedly refuelled, takes the flag third, ahead of Villapadierna and Zehender.","q":false,"c":2}]}